        "retry-rule": {
          "text": "Retried: 429, 502, 503 and 504 always. 409 only when the cdf-is-auto-retryable header is 'true'. 408 is retried except on the /models/instances/query endpoint. Non-408 statuses allow MaxRetries 10 with base delay 1000 ms. 408 allows MaxRetries408 2 with base delay 2000 ms. The delay is random jitter up to min(base times 2^retry, 60000 ms). GraphQL HTTP 200 responses that carry both errors and data are retried with the 408 budget.",
